Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.10,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,A trecut ceva timp, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.69,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,De când nu ne-am mai văzut toți trei.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.10,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.06,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Scuze că nu am putut mai curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.48,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.86,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Eu mă bucur că măcar ne putem vedea.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.36,0:00:52.37,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vara a venit din nou, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.71,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,A mai trecut un an, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.59,0:01:02.71,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.19,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Tu ești Aoi?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.19,0:01:23.23,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Oh, da.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.23,0:01:26.40,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Grozav. Eu sunt Sugisaki Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.86,0:01:27.73,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să te cunosc.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.65,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ce persoane nerăbdătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.07,0:01:32.45,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Încă mai aveam cinci minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.95,0:01:34.99,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Ryou.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.41,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să vă cunosc.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:36.41,0:01:37.54,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.54,0:01:39.91,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Bun. Se pare că suntem cu toții aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Începem?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.30,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Mai întâi, să recapitulăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.67,0:01:52.51,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ne-am adunat astăzi aici \Nca să găsim o fantomă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.76,0:01:54.09,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Fantoma verii, mai exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.55,0:01:55.72,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,În ultimii ani,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.35,0:01:58.10,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,a fost observată în fiecare \Nvară undeva pe aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.68,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Am auzit că trebuie să ai artificii.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.10,0:02:01.98,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Artificii?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.56,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Da. Se pare că toți cei care \Nau văzut-o se jucau cu ele.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.27,0:02:07.90,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Se presupune că e o fată \Nde vreo douăzeci și un pic.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.15,0:02:11.70,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Are părul lung și e îmbrăcată în negru.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.61,0:02:15.53,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dacă ar fi s-o desenez, \Nprobabil ar arăta ceva de genul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.91,0:02:16.95,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Chiar te pricepi.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.49,0:02:20.12,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,O fată drăguță, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.67,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dacă zvonurile sunt adevărate, atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.42,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,asta e fantoma unei \Npersoane care s-a sinucis.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.18,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.18,0:02:34.80,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,O-Oh, nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.43,0:02:39.26,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Doar că am stat puțin pe gânduri și\Nmi-am dat seama că mi-e frică de fantome.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.06,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Abia acum ți-ai dat seama de asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.14,0:02:43.89,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Adică, nu trebuie să vii dacă nu vrei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.89,0:02:44.52,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Eu sigur merg.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.27,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Scuze! Am spus un lucru \Nstupid! Vin și eu cu voi!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.82,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,E adevărat că mi-e frică, dar doar puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.82,0:02:55.45,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Oh, apropo, de ce vrei să vezi \Naceastă fantomă, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.45,0:02:58.24,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Doar tu ne-ai spus despre ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.99,0:03:00.70,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.29,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce? Haide, spune-ne!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.46,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ce rece ești, omule.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.29,0:03:10.75,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Sugisaki.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.63,0:03:15.26,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,A, A, A, A, A...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.05,0:03:17.68,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Bună treabă.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.68,0:03:20.22,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Nu încetezi niciodată \Nsă mă impresionezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.51,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Mi-aș dori ca restul elevilor \Nsă învețe câte ceva de la tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.22,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.64,0:03:26.98,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Sugisaki.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.98,0:03:27.75,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.65,0:03:31.69,Dialogue,Te,0,0,0,,Vei ajunge departe.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.97,0:03:55.42,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.51,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Te-a furat cumva peisajul?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.68,0:04:01.51,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Am ajuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.90,0:04:14.99,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce zonă întinsă!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.99,0:04:17.07,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Acest loc obișnuia să fie un aeroport.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.07,0:04:19.07,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Am auzit că a fost închis \Ndeoarece nu aducea profit.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.74,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Hei! Haideți să-i dăm drumul.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.21,0:04:31.34,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Chiar credeți că există \Naceastă fantomă a verii?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.09,0:04:33.30,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Cine știe?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.30,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Se spune că artificiile liniștesc \Nsufletele celor morți.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.68,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Atunci, sper să le vadă.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.10,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Se pare că nu a apărut.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.65,0:04:52.61,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Și am folosit atât de multe artificii.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.90,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Bun. Asta e ultima.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.90,0:04:55.78,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Poftim, Aoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.66,0:05:08.91,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Știi, Tomoya, chiar \Ncredeam că o vom vedea.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.50,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Sunt puțin trist că nu s-a arătat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.67,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Totuși, nu m-am mai \Ndistrat așa de mult timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.01,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că v-am întâlnit.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.97,0:05:18.80,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.02,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,La naiba, frige!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.15,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce a fost asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.44,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,De ce pocnește mai puternic acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.69,0:05:35.52,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,E reală.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.08,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Tu ești fantoma verii?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.08,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.37,0:05:50.79,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cu ce ocazie pe aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.21,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ce ați putea dori
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.84,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,de la cineva care e deja mort?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.07,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{\an8}Direct în cap!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.87,Dialogue Overlap,B,0,0,0,,{\an8}O lovitură perfectă, omule.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.07,0:06:24.87,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bună treabă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Ce naiba faci?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.87,0:06:34.96,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Nu fi nebună!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.96,0:06:36.42,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Nu te mai zbate și treci înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.96,0:06:36.42,Dialogue Overlap,Ao,0,0,0,,Dă-mi drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.92,0:06:40.26,Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,În sfârșit, s-a decis să vină la școală și deja o luăm de la capăt?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.26,0:06:44.05,Dialogue,E,0,0,0,,Dacă mă întrebi pe mine, \Ntipa are probleme cu capul.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.22,0:06:55.19,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Și fantomele fac grupuri și \Nse iau de fantomele singure?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.90,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cine știe?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.40,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,S-ar putea să fim toate singure.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.28,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce ușurare.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.99,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Îmi place mai mult așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.99,0:07:09.62,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Știu. Să fii în preajma altora nu înseamna doar momente fericite.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.83,0:07:12.62,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.08,0:07:16.46,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nimic. Doar am observat că nu s-a stins.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.17,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate. Destul de horror.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.75,0:07:24.55,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Hei. Ești genul de persoană \Ncare nu are prieteni la școală?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.51,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De asta vrei să mori?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.56,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Faza e că nu toți mă pot vedea.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.56,0:07:32.43,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ci doar cei care
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.98,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,sunt pe jumătate morți.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.64,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Deci și Tomoya, și Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.07,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cum rămâne cu voi doi?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.61,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Aveți vreo întrebare?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.20,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Fantomă a verii, ești...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.45,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Satou Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.71,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Și eu am un nume.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ayane, ești o fantomă, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.96,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Oricine devine una după moarte?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.34,0:08:01.42,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cine știe?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.13,0:08:03.71,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să afli, mai exact?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.01,0:08:07.34,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Cum percep fantomele lumea?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.05,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Sunt curios.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.05,0:08:12.18,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Mi-aș dori să-ți pot spune.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.23,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu e ceva ușor de explicat.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.27,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Unele lucruri le înțelegi abia \Ndupă ce ai devenit o fantomă.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.86,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Se pare că e momentul să plec.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.94,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,M-am distrat vorbind cu voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.03,0:08:25.78,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ne mai vedem.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.49,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Buhuhu.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.07,0:08:33.12,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,B-Buhuhu.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.29,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Deci fantomele chiar există, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.67,Dialogue,Dc,0,0,0,,Asta e tot pentru astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.26,0:08:47.26,Dialogue,Dc,0,0,0,,Dacă simți ceva în neregulă, \Nsună-mă imediat.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.59,0:08:48.80,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.76,Dialogue,Dc,0,0,0,,Părinții tăi nu au venit astăzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.43,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Le-am spus să rămână acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.97,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu are rost să vină aici doar ca să plângă.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.23,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Văd că te antrenezi din greu.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.07,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Kobayashi!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.11,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu ne-am văzut de ceva vreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.70,0:09:11.53,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Hei, de ce ai renunțat la baschet?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.99,0:09:13.95,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Așa mi-a venit.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Așa ți-a venit?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.04,0:09:19.16,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Voi muri curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.16,0:09:19.62,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.38,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Au spus că mai am nouă luni de trăit.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.80,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu voi mai apuca să văd cireșii înfloriți.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.26,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Glumeam.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.35,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Chiar m-ai crezut?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.77,0:09:39.35,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Oh, haide. Nu mă speria așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.06,Dialogue,Kh,0,0,0,,Chiar îmi făceam griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.66,0:10:01.25,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.08,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Trebuie să vorbim.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.71,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.38,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Știu că mă auzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.21,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vin acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.80,0:10:13.22,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Asta sunt șansele tale să fii acceptat pe baza simulărilor din primul trimestru.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.14,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Notele tale la matematică \Nsunt de trecere, deși nu cu mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.76,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Dar mai ai de lucru la literatura contemporană.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.27,0:10:20.06,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Nu poți să scrii pur și simplu ce gândești.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.73,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Trebuie să urmezi modelul.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.40,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Știu că știi asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.90,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,De ce ai probleme doar la asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.79,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce? Mergi la pregătire chiar și duminica?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.25,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da, din moment sunt \Nîn ultimul an de liceu.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.54,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce? Eu încă mai am un an după ăsta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.54,0:10:45.67,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ești mai mare ca mine, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.67,0:10:48.46,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Serios? Asta înseamnă că \Nești în clasa a XI-a, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.66,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce? Și tu ești mai mare?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.43,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Da, dar nu contează. Suntem prieteni.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.49,0:11:17.53,Dialogue,Ao/Ry,0,0,0,,{\pos(306,1020)}Alo?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.49,0:11:17.53,Dialogue,Ao/Ry,0,0,0,,{\pos(1614,1020)}Alo?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.53,0:11:19.66,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ce este, Aoi?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.66,0:11:20.79,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,S-a întâmplat ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.79,0:11:23.87,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Nu. Nimic special.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.87,0:11:25.37,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.92,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,încă nu-mi vine să cred că am văzut acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.92,0:11:31.05,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu-ți bate capul prea mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.55,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ar fi ciudat dacă {\i1}nu{\i0} ai fi speriată.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.09,0:11:36.93,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.47,0:11:38.55,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.55,0:11:40.60,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Aproape am ajuns acasă, deci voi închide.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.39,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că nu era nimic grav.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.35,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ne mai auzim.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.61,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Hei. Mă bucur să te revăd.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.65,0:11:56.20,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ceva îmi spune că nu ești mulțumit de răspunsul primit data trecută.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.70,0:11:57.95,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu complet.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.58,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vrei să fii mulțumit complet, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.83,0:12:07.79,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt curioasă. De ce ești în viață?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.50,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Chiar ți se pare că sunt viu?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.75,0:12:12.75,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Așa aș spune.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.17,0:12:17.55,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Să fiu sincer, nu mă simt așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.51,0:12:23.06,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Uneori chiar mă întreb \Ndacă nu sunt deja mort.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.85,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Asta pentru că ești mort în interior.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.35,0:12:28.19,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Iar asta nu e bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.65,0:12:30.31,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să aud asta de la o fantomă.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.86,0:12:33.11,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Deci ce vei face în legătură cu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.74,0:12:36.90,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.16,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Asta speram să aflu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.24,0:12:46.54,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Aș scăpa de toate grijile și toată suferința dacă aș deveni o fantomă?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.21,0:12:51.63,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,M-am gândit că s-ar schimba ceva dacă aș afla răspunsul la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.42,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.67,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Există un singur mod de a afla.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.76,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Haide să-ți oferim o \Nschimbare de perspectivă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.68,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu-ți dorești să zbori?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.07,0:13:17.99,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.90,0:13:21.78,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ești gata? Asigură-te că te ții bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.38,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cum este?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.80,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Corpul tău e pe pământ, \Ndar sufletul tău zboară!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.18,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ești liber acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.51,0:13:44.97,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,E incredibil!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.98,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,H-Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.50,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunt în pământ?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.84,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Scuze, nu m-am putut abține.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.84,0:14:20.05,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Voiam să văd cum vei reacționa.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.38,0:14:22.09,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,A-Asta a fost foarte răutăcios.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.84,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Dar mi-am cerut scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.34,0:14:27.47,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Te voi învăța cum să \Nzbori și vom fi chit, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.64,0:14:30.81,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Privește adânc înăuntrul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.43,0:14:34.48,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Gândește-te la ceea \Nce-ți dorești cel mai mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.90,0:14:38.23,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sufletul tău va merge \Nacolo unde-ți vei dori să fii.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.07,0:14:41.36,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Haide, gândește-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.28,0:14:44.11,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Unde vrei să mergi?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.21,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Îți plac picturile, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.21,0:14:59.88,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da. Deși am renunțat la pictură.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.88,0:15:02.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Doar există lucruri mult \Nmai importante în viață.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.76,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Deci de asta pari atât de rupt de realitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.55,0:15:06.97,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Mare păcat.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.81,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Alegi să dai cu piciorul acestei oportunițăți.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.35,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ești o fantomă acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.81,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nimeni nu se poate supăra pe tine, știi?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.80,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt frumoase, nu-i așa? \NLuminile orașului.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.63,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.38,0:15:49.60,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Deși, puteau fi și mai strălucitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.31,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Din moment ce nu sunt \Naprinse toate deodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.31,0:15:54.56,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Haide, nu vei cuceri nicio fată astfel.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.56,0:15:56.14,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Doar spune mersi ca o persoană normală.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.85,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.32,0:16:03.07,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Hei, te pot întreba ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.53,0:16:04.15,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.41,0:16:08.62,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,De ce te-ai sinucis?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.03,0:16:12.24,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.83,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles greșit.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.71,0:16:18.08,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu m-am sinucis.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.88,0:16:20.92,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ești curios?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.05,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Atunci, îți voi spune povestea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.34,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Adevărul este că...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.39,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am fost ucisă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.93,0:16:34.02,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Unde suntem?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.27,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Asta e casa mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.10,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Acum, mama mea locuiește singură aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.27,0:16:45.65,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,În urmă cu trei ani, am avut o \Nceartă destul de serioasă cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.44,0:16:50.16,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ba chiar pentru ceva foarte stupid.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.57,0:16:54.24,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am ieșit în fugă din casă \Npe o ploaie torențială.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.50,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Și când încercam să traversez strada,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.58,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,am fost lovită de o \Nmașină care trecea pe roșu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.00,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,E un mod așa stupid de a muri.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.84,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ei bine, cu excepția faptului \Ncă nu am murit fix atunci.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.76,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Eram doar inconștientă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.97,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Dar când m-am trezit, \Neram blocată într-un loc foarte mic.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.85,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Probabil un geamantan.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.85,0:17:18.94,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.90,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ca să acopere urmele accidentului.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.27,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Șoferul acelei mașini m-a îngropat undeva.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.19,0:17:29.03,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu puteam respira, iar singurul lucru pe care-l puteam auzi era sunetul vag al ploii.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.62,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Asta e ultima mea amintire \Nde când eram în viață.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.04,0:17:38.41,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Mama mea încă așteaptă să mă întorc.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.75,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Unde ai fost îngropată?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.25,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am încercat să găsesc \Nacel loc, dar am renunțat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.71,0:17:45.75,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu e ca și cum ar schimba ceva acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.46,0:17:51.76,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vai, și voiam să fac atât de multe lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.22,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Să călătoresc, să mă îndrăgostesc...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.72,0:17:57.27,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt invidioasă pe viitorul \Nstrălucit care te așteaptă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.98,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar {\i1}poți{\i0} călători, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.56,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ba chiar nu te costă nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.56,0:18:03.52,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.86,0:18:05.90,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Asta nu a fost prea drăguț.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.61,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Minus douăzeci de puncte.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.40,0:18:13.11,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Personal, cred că ceea ce \Nai tu acum e mult mai bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.41,0:18:16.24,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.66,0:18:17.79,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.75,0:18:21.50,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vreau să-mi găsesc corpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.38,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Cred că aș putea reuși cu ajutorul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.92,0:18:30.88,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am renunțat doar pentru că nu aș fi putut face nimic chiar dacă l-aș fi găsit.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.97,0:18:39.17,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Oh, îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.98,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Încercam doar să te înveselesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.73,0:18:43.19,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Prefă-te că nu am spus nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.94,0:18:46.19,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Buhuhu.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.19,0:19:32.03,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Nu ar trebui să fii la pregătire?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.11,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Urcă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.95,0:19:38.45,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,E deja al doilea trimestru.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.16,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Pierdeai timpul pe undeva, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.33,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Nu mă poți minți.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.33,0:19:46.29,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Îmi caut un prieten.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.71,0:19:47.88,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.71,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Este {\i1}asta{\i0} mai important decât viitorul tău?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.76,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Săptămâna viitoare voi veni la școala unde faci pregătire ca să mă asigur că ești acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.34,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Nu fugi de îndatoririle tale.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.47,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,T-Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.89,0:19:58.76,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Unde te duci?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.90,0:20:13.19,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu l-am putut găsi nici astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.69,0:20:15.53,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.41,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.41,0:20:18.66,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu trebuie să-ți pară.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.24,0:20:21.20,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Gândește-te la asta ca \Nla o întâlnire mai mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.25,0:20:25.91,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Am examenele de admitere anul acesta.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.50,0:20:32.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Când voi începe facultatea, \Nnu știu cât voi mai putea veni aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:33.67,0:20:34.63,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.09,0:20:38.34,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Atunci, haide să ne încheiem călătoria de căutare a sufletului aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.34,0:20:38.72,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.34,0:20:42.26,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vara e pe sfârșite.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.85,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,E momentul potrivit să ne oprim.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.85,0:20:45.73,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar nu trebuie să renunțăm comple...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.73,0:20:47.10,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,E în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.98,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să te distrag.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.98,0:20:53.65,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ai lucruri mult mai importante decât mine la care să te gândești.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.32,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.32,0:20:55.99,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Minus două milioane de puncte.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.90,0:20:59.28,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu vei cuceri nicio fată fiind încăpățânat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.11,0:21:02.24,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am spus deja că e în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.83,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Asta înseamnă că nu vei mai \Nfi pe aici pentru mult timp?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.54,0:21:08.50,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Probabil.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.17,0:21:11.29,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.59,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ne vedem mâine seară.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.38,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Să mă aștepți, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.01,0:21:20.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ne putem întâlni?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.47,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vreau să vorbim despre ceva anume.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.39,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vreau să-i găsesc corpul lui Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.06,0:21:28.73,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Mă veți ajuta?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.77,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mă gândeam eu că era ceva de genul.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.73,0:21:35.36,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Te vezi destul de des cu \Nea în ultima vreme, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.36,0:21:37.09,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce? Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.11,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Te-ai îndrăgostit cumva?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.82,0:21:40.53,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu, nu e asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.03,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nu contează.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.87,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu plănuiesc să ajut, oricum.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.08,0:21:48.54,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu prea-mi vine să ajut \Npe cineva care s-a sinucis.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.54,0:21:49.62,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu asta s-a întâmplat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.36,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu a fost vina ei că a murit.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.58,0:21:54.09,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Asta e foarte important.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.67,0:21:56.34,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dacă nu voi duce acest lucru până la capăt,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.00,0:21:59.13,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,nu cred că mă voi putea ierta vreodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.63,0:22:00.72,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.22,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Atunci, mult noroc.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:03.76,0:22:04.22,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.22,0:22:05.26,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Încetează.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.26,0:22:05.51,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Stai...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.51,0:22:06.76,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus să încetezi!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.64,0:22:09.98,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Renunță.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.48,0:22:11.56,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să aud nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.81,0:22:15.90,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Trebuie să fie drăguț să ai un viitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.36,0:22:18.94,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Dar eu nu voi avea parte \Nde un asemenea lux.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.49,0:22:20.82,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:21.45,0:22:22.57,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.08,0:22:36.50,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,S-a întâmplat ceva, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.50,0:22:38.67,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu. Nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.63,0:22:40.42,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Haide să începem.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.22,0:22:42.38,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îți vom găsi corpul astăzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.85,0:22:47.81,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.85,0:22:49.56,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:02.53,0:23:03.07,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.07,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu te apropia!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:06.37,0:23:07.45,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Doar lasă-mă în pace.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:11.50,0:23:12.66,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:14.67,0:23:18.38,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu prea ne ajută faptul că nu poți merge prea departe de corpul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:18.38,0:23:20.88,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar nu mă voi opri până \Nnu ți-l vom găsi pe al tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.92,0:23:23.97,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.60,0:23:28.80,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Te rog, lasă-mă în pace.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.14,0:23:32.22,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Am știut mereu.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.65,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,A fost o greșeală să mă văd cu voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:37.77,0:23:40.98,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Aș fi suferit mult mai puțin \Ndacă aș fi murit de unul singur.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.49,0:23:44.32,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,De ce am ales să fac așa ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.45,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,De ce eu?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.12,0:23:50.41,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,De ce e lumea asta atât de nedreaptă?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.83,0:23:52.79,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:53.87,0:23:58.17,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Nu voi încerca să mă prefac că înțeleg, dar măcar ascultă-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.38,0:24:02.46,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ceilalți elevi se iau de mine la școală.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.42,0:24:05.17,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Îmi este destul de greu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.18,0:24:11.68,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Începusem să-mi pierd speranța că voi înțelege vreodată de ce sunt în viață.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:12.93,0:24:18.60,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Pentru mine, căutarea unei fantome era, de fapt, căutarea unor răspunsuri noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:19.56,0:24:22.57,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Poate că tu te confrunți \Ncu ceva complet diferit,
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.90,0:24:26.15,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,dar sunt sigură că și Tomoya \Nduce propria sa luptă.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.53,0:24:31.37,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trebuie{\i0} să existe o semnificație \Nîn faptul că ne-am întâlnit.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.00,0:24:36.12,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.75,0:24:40.21,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.21,0:24:41.46,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ayane!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.30,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Mă poți auzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:47.68,0:24:50.30,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu mă așteptam ca tu, dintre toți oamenii, să vii atât de nepregătit.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:52.35,0:24:54.68,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Chiar îți dai silința, omule?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.60,0:25:00.52,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:01.31,0:25:06.90,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Am fost atât de concentrat la mine însumi încât nu m-am gândit și la situația ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.53,0:25:10.11,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Urăsc oamenii ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.32,0:25:13.45,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Crezi că ți-ai dat seama de tot,
Dialogue: 99,0:25:13.70,0:25:16.37,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,dar tu ești mai demn de \Nmilă decât toți ceilalți.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.62,0:25:20.12,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Deci bănuiesc că te voi ajuta.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:21.04,0:25:22.46,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Să-i mulțumești lui Aoi pentru asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:24.38,0:25:25.21,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ryou.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.42,0:25:28.55,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Haide să termin odată cu asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:32.47,0:25:33.64,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:58.95,0:26:01.08,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Crezi că-mi vom găsi corpul?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:01.42,0:26:04.21,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Desigur. Acum suntem patru.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.25,0:26:09.13,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu credeam că ați merge \Natât de departe pentru mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:09.84,0:26:11.77,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vă sunt foarte recunoscătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:12.59,0:26:14.55,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nimic nu e mai grozav \Ndecât să ai prieteni, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:15.72,0:26:16.68,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Să-i prețuiești.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.60,0:26:21.02,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:21.35,0:26:22.73,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Aoi? Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:22.73,0:26:23.70,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Veniți repede!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:24.15,0:26:27.15,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Cred că am găsit geamantanul.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:32.03,0:26:33.74,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Privește, Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:34.20,0:26:35.83,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Mersi. Voi merge să verific.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:38.54,0:26:40.33,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Mă întreb ce se va întâmpla cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:41.21,0:26:44.92,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Va dispărea odată ce-și va găsi corpul?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:46.13,0:26:47.92,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Asta e puțin trist.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:51.26,0:26:53.43,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate. Corpul meu e aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:53.68,0:26:55.76,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Grozav! Haideți să ne întoarcem.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.76,0:26:56.14,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:57.97,0:26:58.81,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt așa fericită.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:59.93,0:27:02.49,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sper ca mama să se poate \Nîmpăca cu gândul acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:03.19,0:27:05.98,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Deci {\i1}chiar{\i0} vei dispărea, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:06.69,0:27:07.90,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Așa cred.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.65,0:27:10.65,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Dar m-am distrat foarte mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.65,0:27:12.82,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Am profitat la maxim de \Ntimpul meu rămas aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:17.03,0:27:17.78,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:19.24,0:27:20.46,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Dă tot ce poți.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.00,0:27:27.38,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Trebuie să continui să trăiești.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:29.38,0:27:31.38,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Uite. S-a trezit, în sfârșit.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:31.63,0:27:33.30,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Iar te-a furat peisajul?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:33.30,0:27:33.92,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:33.92,0:27:35.26,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:35.55,0:27:37.05,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt puțin îngrijorată.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.05,0:27:39.47,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Te-ai distrat atât de mult ca fantomă.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:40.26,0:27:46.02,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sper că nu ai început să crezi că moartea ar putea să nu fie o soluție atât de rea.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:47.77,0:27:48.98,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vai, vai.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:52.48,0:27:55.10,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău că te-am implicat în asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:59.28,0:27:59.70,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:59.70,0:28:01.29,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Sunt bine. Luați-o înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:02.12,0:28:03.87,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu o faceți pe Ayane să aștepte.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:11.50,0:28:12.50,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Trebuie să fie aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:12.50,0:28:13.34,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.80,0:28:15.01,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Dar cum vom intra?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:15.84,0:28:19.72,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Și tu ai problemele tale, iar eu am fost egoistă și te-am implicat în ale mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:21.18,0:28:21.89,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Și, în cele din urmă,
Dialogue: 99,0:28:23.10,0:28:25.18,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,eu voi merge mai departe fără tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:26.60,0:28:28.27,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Să nu-ți fie dor de mine, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.27,0:28:29.15,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:28:30.31,0:28:31.94,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Eu vreau să te găsesc, Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:32.57,0:28:33.73,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Asta e tot ce contează acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:37.40,0:28:38.28,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:41.53,0:28:43.62,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că asta îți va oferi \Nrăspunsurile pe care le cauți.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:44.45,0:28:48.83,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Pentru tine, moartea reprezintă viitorul, iar pentru mine, trecutul.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:49.92,0:28:52.00,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ea ne leagă pe noi doi acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:01.43,0:29:02.26,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:02.26,0:29:05.27,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Totul depinde de tine acum, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:30.33,0:29:30.75,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Să mergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:31.96,0:29:34.38,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.75,0:29:35.71,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.68,0:29:43.64,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ai petrecut prea mult timp \Nseparat de corpul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:44.14,0:29:45.76,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De asta ești acum aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:47.89,0:29:49.06,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Acest loc reprezintă moartea.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:49.94,0:29:51.06,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Nu există nimic aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:51.60,0:29:54.23,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Dar este, de asemenea, \Nlocul unde ești tu acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:57.74,0:29:59.89,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Odată ce vei aprinde asta și o vei lăsa să ardă, totul se va termina.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.45,0:30:02.78,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Vei lăsa în urmă lumea reală.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:09.08,0:30:11.67,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Da. Bănuiesc că nu ar trebui să facem asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:13.17,0:30:15.00,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De ce ești trist acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:17.34,0:30:20.34,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Ce-ți dorești cu adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.81,0:30:35.15,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:36.32,0:30:38.32,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ce naiba faci?! Revino-ți!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:38.32,0:30:38.98,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Ryou?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:38.98,0:30:41.03,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ai vrut să faci asta mai \Nmult decât oricine altcineva.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:41.03,0:30:43.28,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Așa că fă-ți treaba până la căpat!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:43.28,0:30:45.70,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,De ce ai renunța acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:46.53,0:30:48.49,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nici nu mă gândesc să te las s-o faci!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:49.45,0:30:52.62,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Nu. Trebuie să mă întorc.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:52.62,0:30:53.67,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:57.75,0:30:59.38,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Care-i rostul?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:00.05,0:31:03.80,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De ce te-ai agăța de o lume \Ncare doar te face să suferi?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:08.68,0:31:09.31,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,De ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:15.15,0:31:18.77,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate. Viața mea a fost \Ndoar o povară până acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:20.03,0:31:21.44,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar nu s-a terminat încă!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:22.57,0:31:25.28,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Exact ca Ryou și Aoi,
Dialogue: 99,0:31:25.78,0:31:29.95,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,am învățat că dacă privesc în sus, mereu e cineva care va vrea să te ajute să te ridici.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.33,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Tu nu ești Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.33,0:31:35.29,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Tu ești acea parte din mine care caută un motiv ca să moară!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.21,0:31:40.42,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Trebuie să mă întorc în lumea \Nreală și s-o găsesc pe Ayane.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.09,0:31:42.80,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îmi va suna ceasul într-o bună zi.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.67,0:31:46.01,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Iar ceasul lui Ayane a sunat deja.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:46.72,0:31:47.68,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.30,0:31:50.60,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Trebuie să mă împac cu \Naceste lucruri, mai întâi!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:13.45,0:32:13.95,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:13.95,0:32:14.37,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.74,0:32:46.78,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Ce bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:00.00,0:33:02.88,Dialogue,Ay,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc că m-ai găsit.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:19.39,0:33:20.60,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Imediat.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:33.58,0:33:34.49,Dialogue,Mo,0,0,0,,Ayane?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:17.66,0:34:20.50,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Vara a venit din nou, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:24.63,0:34:27.42,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ce mai faceți?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:28.05,0:34:29.46,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Sunteți bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:32.13,0:34:32.93,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:34.93,0:34:36.05,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Oarecum.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.68,0:34:44.56,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Să trăiești pentru tine însuți nu e așa de ușor precum credeam.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:45.44,0:34:46.19,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,De acord.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:48.94,0:34:51.53,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Desigur, viața nu mi-a \Ndevenit roz dintr-odată, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.83,0:35:00.70,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,C-Cât timp mai aveți de gând să vă comportați ca niște copii de grădiniță?!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:00.70,0:35:02.83,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Simt măcar că fac pași \Nmici în direcția cea bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.33,0:35:10.21,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Poate ar fi fost mult mai ușor dacă aș fi făcut ce mi se spunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:11.34,0:35:12.84,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Sunt momente când mă \Nîndoiesc de mine însumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:14.55,0:35:15.43,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Dar va fi bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:16.55,0:35:20.60,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Toate lucrurile au un sfârșit.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:20.89,0:35:23.10,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,De fiecare dată când mă gândesc \Nla asta, frica îmi dispare.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:25.35,0:35:28.86,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Îmi voi lua singur deciziile.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:34.36,0:35:35.45,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să aud asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:41.58,0:35:42.87,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Se pare că timpul s-a scurs.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.83,0:35:45.67,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că am reușit să stăm de vorbă.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:46.42,0:35:48.38,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Din moment ce nu am reușit \Nsă-mi iau rămas bun de la voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:52.76,0:35:54.63,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,De ce m-am născut?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:55.38,0:35:57.34,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Ăsta era singurul meu gând.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:59.10,0:36:05.02,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Dar am reușit să apuc următoarea primăvară {\i1}deoarece{\i0} am crezut că mă voi vindeca.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:06.90,0:36:10.69,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu mai plânge pentru cineva \Ncare a murit acum câteva luni.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.73,0:36:14.99,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Sunt sigur că lucrurile vă vor merge bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:15.78,0:36:19.12,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Nu am vreo dovadă anume, \Ndar vă garantez asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:20.28,0:36:21.04,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:22.29,0:36:23.12,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Aoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:24.91,0:36:26.21,Dialogue,Ry,0,0,0,,Trăiți-vă viața cât de bine puteți.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:49.02,0:36:50.12,Dialogue,Ao,0,0,0,,Haide să ne întoarcem.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:53.36,0:36:54.18,Dialogue,To,0,0,0,,Da.
